            "paragraph": "For the purpose of setting an objective approach, the vertical profiles of wind speeds are examined from radiosonde observations. Figure 2 indicates the composited profiles of wind speeds for no-rain (referred to as N in NT11), rain (referred to as R in NT11), and strong rain cases (referred to as S in NT11) from the 35-year radiosonde data at Tateno at 0900 JST\u00b9.",
